.DS_Store
.direnv/
.idea/
.scratch/
/.tool-versions
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zst
!**/testdata/**
coverage.out

# Added for goreleaser:
/dist/

# Build output: the filesystem_mirror hack/dev-mirror.sh writes and the fleet state and package
# cache the e2e suite fills. Anchored, so it matches only the directory at the repository root.
/build/

# Added for go mod vendor. The tree is committed, as it is in colonel-byte/cargoship: a build
# has to work with no module proxy reachable. Vendoring lands in its own change -- it is a large
# diff and nothing else should be reviewed underneath it -- and it waits for the `replace`
# directive in go.mod to go, since vendoring over a local replace records that path in
# vendor/modules.txt and nobody else can reproduce the tree.
!/vendor/

# The provider binary a local build produces, and the plugin cache a terragrunt example fills.
/terraform-provider-cargoship
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
